# World Vibe content-item share pages: the three curated topics are static
# folders (world-vibe/share/<topic>/index.html) and are served as those exact
# assets before any redirect rule is evaluated, so they keep working
# unchanged. Every other /world-vibe/share/<slug> falls through to this
# redirect, which preserves older browser share links while moving them to the
# canonical item query form.
#
# Arbitrary legacy share paths are handled by the matching Pages Function.
# Pages skips _redirects when a Function route matches. The Function preserves
# curated static pages and serves the shared item document for a validated
# arbitrary slug; item.js then replaces the visible URL with the canonical
# query form.
